{"about_the_game":"<strong>Notice: Requires controllers for more than one local player.</strong><br><br>Cutthroat is a party game that brings stealth gameplay to the local multiplayer screen. Players must stay hidden in a crowd of identical NPCs while finding and taking out the other players. The game has four classes, each with unique abilities that help you blend in with the crowd and eliminate the other players. To win you must use strategy and deception instead of relying on quick reflexes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete Missions to Hone Your Skills.<br></li><li>Battle against other players in free for all matches. <br></li><li>Team up with friends in Team Death Match. <br></li><li>Play on multiple maps with unique effects that alter gameplay. <br></li><li>Choose between four unique classes and try different strategies.</li></ul><br>Think fast and keep your wits about you to stab your friends!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a33e186b02e537d33ad382fb4eaed10ebf02fc9b.jpg","localized_name":"Many Faces","name":"Many Faces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/737380/a33e186b02e537d33ad382fb4eaed10ebf02fc9b.jpg"},{"icon":"20b62d83045b804fe958af0895687c547c09cd29.jpg","localized_name":"Well Traveled","name":"Well Traveled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/737380/20b62d83045b804fe958af0895687c547c09cd29.jpg"},{"icon":"6411baa8deef62d6da51d7bf3e1ea93d85448d34.jpg","localized_name":"Adventurous","name":"Adventurous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/737380/6411baa8deef62d6da51d7bf3e1ea93d85448d34.jpg"},{"icon":"5002d4c873c0568eb728a6e71136f5f15ab23327.jpg","localized_name":"First Steps","name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/737380/5002d4c873c0568eb728a6e71136f5f15ab23327.jpg"},{"icon":"cf99995ac8a2f8c7da8a70ce2bada944674fa